2. Proposed DMA Grouping (Why 3 Behavioral Groups Instead of 196 Raw DMAs)
Rather than modeling all 196 DMAs separately (where small markets are too noisy) or creating separate city lists per product (unnecessary given the 0.99 DMA correlation), we segmented all 196 DMAs by actual Summer-to-Winter sales behavior (May–Aug vs. Nov–Feb avg weekly sales) plus a Core (Top 100) vs. Tail (#101–196) size flag:
